{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/4676ffc4469e7b87ab9f632fef33fda3.poster.avif?t=1773127691\" width=620 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/4676ffc4469e7b87ab9f632fef33fda3.webm?t=1773127691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/2e15d2304a38a706723746566e9b1a92.avif?t=1773127691\" width=620 height=164 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/f7348ca1d1b368f76d32978ce7c94e16.poster.avif?t=1773127691\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/f7348ca1d1b368f76d32978ce7c94e16.webm?t=1773127691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/f7348ca1d1b368f76d32978ce7c94e16.mp4?t=1773127691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/26ea7648a296b7ddf7bfe090b81bfd26.poster.avif?t=1773127691\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/26ea7648a296b7ddf7bfe090b81bfd26.webm?t=1773127691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/26ea7648a296b7ddf7bfe090b81bfd26.mp4?t=1773127691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Miyuki, a woman in her late 20s whose new marriage is shattered by the sudden, mysterious death of her husband. As you search for the truth, you\u2019ll navigate love, loss, and the shadows of a dangerous cult\u2014making choices that could heal or break you. Along the way, you\u2019ll meet 4 unique male leads, each connected to Miyuki in a deeply personal way. Some may protect you, some may deceive you, and some might blur the line between the two. Beyond entertainment, Lover\u2019s Enigma also raises awareness of emotional well-being and trauma recovery, woven naturally into its narrative. It\u2019s not just a story you play\u2014it\u2019s an experience that reflects on resilience in the face of grief.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/e883f9e758750943c41b300ffb85113f.avif?t=1773127691\" width=620 height=164 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/7cb7b1f5734f3e43b8dd93d5af4f34b3.avif?t=1773127691\" width=620 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 4 Male Leads you will meet over the course of the game. Each one of them connects to you in some way or another.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/fd9f1dc8d43e2c026c967a340b2679b2.avif?t=1773127691\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras_big/fd9f1dc8d43e2c026c967a340b2679b2.avif?t=1773127691 width=800 height=798 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/ba7c8920fc5a516a9ad859b1d45480b5.avif?t=1773127691\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras_big/ba7c8920fc5a516a9ad859b1d45480b5.avif?t=1773127691 width=800 height=798 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/1eadf04395f725622ce54a51e4a5814f.avif?t=1773127691\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras_big/1eadf04395f725622ce54a51e4a5814f.avif?t=1773127691 width=800 height=798 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/39998dc89878ff2c1ff9c038accabfc4.avif?t=1773127691\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras_big/39998dc89878ff2c1ff9c038accabfc4.avif?t=1773127691 width=800 height=798 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/8517f7b9383beec390d9628c0b5bc407.avif?t=1773127691\" width=620 height=164 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This tantalizing tale of trauma and torment will include at minimum:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc8 100,000+ words\u00a0<br>\ud83d\udc98 4 Contrasting Love Interests<br>\ud83d\udc92 6+ endings (both good and bad!)<br>\ud83c\udfa8 14+ CGs\u00a0(TBD)<br>\u270f\ufe0f 10+ partial CGs (TBD)<br>\ud83d\ude4b 8 sprites\u00a0(TBD)<br>\ud83c\udf99\ufe0f Fully voiced calls (TBD)<br>\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f CG Gallery<br>\ud83c\udfb6 Original Soundtrack<br>\ud83c\udfc6 20+ Achievements (TBD)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/a58fd5adaaf0c01b0bae1f9e7f068426.poster.avif?t=1773127691\" width=800 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/a58fd5adaaf0c01b0bae1f9e7f068426.webm?t=1773127691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/a58fd5adaaf0c01b0bae1f9e7f068426.mp4?t=1773127691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Your choices shape their perception of you. Get to know each of the male leads on a deeper level... or push them away. The choice is up to you.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choice-driven narrative with over 10 different endings shaped by your actions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on your actions, the story will be influenced in a certain way that either gives you a happy ending or results in the cult getting their hands on you. Outcomes range from bittersweet romance to chilling tragedy...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a variety of static and fully animated CGs as you progress!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock different animated CGs as you delve more into the world of Lover's Enigma. Fully animated CGs for you to discover!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rhythm mini-game that helps restore sanity\u2014symbolizing small acts of self-care amidst chaos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trying to solve mysteries can be tiring. To relax, you often turn to your phone for games in order to keep calm. Successfully completing these increases your sanity, allowing you to get through another day. There are multiple difficulties, with each harder difficulty you successfully complete, the more your sanity stays.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/6377c90fb48e148888332a0d008de45d.poster.avif?t=1773127691\" width=800 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/6377c90fb48e148888332a0d008de45d.webm?t=1773127691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/6377c90fb48e148888332a0d008de45d.mp4?t=1773127691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/82062d8a28dd1139e62ff067278f75f6.poster.avif?t=1773127691\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/82062d8a28dd1139e62ff067278f75f6.webm?t=1773127691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/82062d8a28dd1139e62ff067278f75f6.mp4?t=1773127691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/afd7af1825dfd0a7b7b879a5f30e93c6.poster.avif?t=1773127691\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/afd7af1825dfd0a7b7b879a5f30e93c6.webm?t=1773127691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/afd7af1825dfd0a7b7b879a5f30e93c6.mp4?t=1773127691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/bcb381612d65e4aceb7961d8fc09d28e.avif?t=1773127691\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras_big/bcb381612d65e4aceb7961d8fc09d28e.webp?t=1773127691 width=1560 height=197 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our Kickstarter campaign has ended, but it's not too late! Late Pledges are currently available, for those who are interested in our merchandise or want to join our beta test at the end of February 2026. If you're one of them, don't miss out on this opportunity!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3123540?t=1773127691","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773127691","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/0685c9c6a09e55dc5c55b17798485273fdd7c64d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773127691","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/0685c9c6a09e55dc5c55b17798485273fdd7c64d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773127691","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"\"Koibito no Nazo\" contains mature themes and content that may not be suitable for all audiences. Players should be aware of the following:\r\n\r\nViolence: The game includes depictions of physical violence, including murder and psychological manipulation.\r\n\r\nSelf-Harm and Suicide: The storyline involves themes of self-harm and suicide, including a character who dies under suspicious circumstances that appear as a suicide.\r\n\r\nMental Health Issues: Themes of depression, anxiety, and PTSD are present, as characters cope with traumatic experiences and their aftermath.\r\n\r\nPlayers who may be sensitive to these themes are advised to proceed with caution. Our aim is to handle these topics with care and respect while delivering a compelling and immersive experience."},"demos":[{"appid":3557290,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/4676ffc4469e7b87ab9f632fef33fda3.poster.avif?t=1773127691\" width=620 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/4676ffc4469e7b87ab9f632fef33fda3.webm?t=1773127691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/2e15d2304a38a706723746566e9b1a92.avif?t=1773127691\" width=620 height=164 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/f7348ca1d1b368f76d32978ce7c94e16.poster.avif?t=1773127691\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/f7348ca1d1b368f76d32978ce7c94e16.webm?t=1773127691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/f7348ca1d1b368f76d32978ce7c94e16.mp4?t=1773127691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/26ea7648a296b7ddf7bfe090b81bfd26.poster.avif?t=1773127691\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/26ea7648a296b7ddf7bfe090b81bfd26.webm?t=1773127691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/26ea7648a296b7ddf7bfe090b81bfd26.mp4?t=1773127691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Miyuki, a woman in her late 20s whose new marriage is shattered by the sudden, mysterious death of her husband. As you search for the truth, you\u2019ll navigate love, loss, and the shadows of a dangerous cult\u2014making choices that could heal or break you. Along the way, you\u2019ll meet 4 unique male leads, each connected to Miyuki in a deeply personal way. Some may protect you, some may deceive you, and some might blur the line between the two. Beyond entertainment, Lover\u2019s Enigma also raises awareness of emotional well-being and trauma recovery, woven naturally into its narrative. It\u2019s not just a story you play\u2014it\u2019s an experience that reflects on resilience in the face of grief.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/e883f9e758750943c41b300ffb85113f.avif?t=1773127691\" width=620 height=164 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/7cb7b1f5734f3e43b8dd93d5af4f34b3.avif?t=1773127691\" width=620 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 4 Male Leads you will meet over the course of the game. Each one of them connects to you in some way or another.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/fd9f1dc8d43e2c026c967a340b2679b2.avif?t=1773127691\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras_big/fd9f1dc8d43e2c026c967a340b2679b2.avif?t=1773127691 width=800 height=798 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/ba7c8920fc5a516a9ad859b1d45480b5.avif?t=1773127691\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras_big/ba7c8920fc5a516a9ad859b1d45480b5.avif?t=1773127691 width=800 height=798 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/1eadf04395f725622ce54a51e4a5814f.avif?t=1773127691\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras_big/1eadf04395f725622ce54a51e4a5814f.avif?t=1773127691 width=800 height=798 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/39998dc89878ff2c1ff9c038accabfc4.avif?t=1773127691\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras_big/39998dc89878ff2c1ff9c038accabfc4.avif?t=1773127691 width=800 height=798 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/8517f7b9383beec390d9628c0b5bc407.avif?t=1773127691\" width=620 height=164 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This tantalizing tale of trauma and torment will include at minimum:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc8 100,000+ words\u00a0<br>\ud83d\udc98 4 Contrasting Love Interests<br>\ud83d\udc92 6+ endings (both good and bad!)<br>\ud83c\udfa8 14+ CGs\u00a0(TBD)<br>\u270f\ufe0f 10+ partial CGs (TBD)<br>\ud83d\ude4b 8 sprites\u00a0(TBD)<br>\ud83c\udf99\ufe0f Fully voiced calls (TBD)<br>\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f CG Gallery<br>\ud83c\udfb6 Original Soundtrack<br>\ud83c\udfc6 20+ Achievements (TBD)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/a58fd5adaaf0c01b0bae1f9e7f068426.poster.avif?t=1773127691\" width=800 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/a58fd5adaaf0c01b0bae1f9e7f068426.webm?t=1773127691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/a58fd5adaaf0c01b0bae1f9e7f068426.mp4?t=1773127691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Your choices shape their perception of you. Get to know each of the male leads on a deeper level... or push them away. The choice is up to you.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choice-driven narrative with over 10 different endings shaped by your actions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on your actions, the story will be influenced in a certain way that either gives you a happy ending or results in the cult getting their hands on you. Outcomes range from bittersweet romance to chilling tragedy...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a variety of static and fully animated CGs as you progress!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock different animated CGs as you delve more into the world of Lover's Enigma. Fully animated CGs for you to discover!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rhythm mini-game that helps restore sanity\u2014symbolizing small acts of self-care amidst chaos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trying to solve mysteries can be tiring. To relax, you often turn to your phone for games in order to keep calm. Successfully completing these increases your sanity, allowing you to get through another day. There are multiple difficulties, with each harder difficulty you successfully complete, the more your sanity stays.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/6377c90fb48e148888332a0d008de45d.poster.avif?t=1773127691\" width=800 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/6377c90fb48e148888332a0d008de45d.webm?t=1773127691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/6377c90fb48e148888332a0d008de45d.mp4?t=1773127691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/82062d8a28dd1139e62ff067278f75f6.poster.avif?t=1773127691\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/82062d8a28dd1139e62ff067278f75f6.webm?t=1773127691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/82062d8a28dd1139e62ff067278f75f6.mp4?t=1773127691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/afd7af1825dfd0a7b7b879a5f30e93c6.poster.avif?t=1773127691\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/afd7af1825dfd0a7b7b879a5f30e93c6.webm?t=1773127691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/afd7af1825dfd0a7b7b879a5f30e93c6.mp4?t=1773127691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123540/extras/bcb38